{"id":"gordost_","lemma":"гордость","pos":"noun","rank":2083,"glosses":["pride"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/84/Ru-%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"гордости","plural":"гордости"},"examples":[{"text":"Новый парк — гордость нашего города.","en":"The new park is the pride of our city.","words":[{"g":"new"},{"g":"park"},null,{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"city, town","l":"город"}]},{"text":"Я чувствовал большую гордость.","en":"I felt very proud.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1091524","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel","l":"чувствовать"},null,null]},{"text":"Ты моя гордость и радость.","en":"You are my pride and joy.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"joy, delight"}]},{"text":"То, что ей движет, — это гордость.","en":"It's pride that drives her.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) her"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Гордость не позволила ему взять деньги.","en":"His pride did not allow him to take the money.","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to allow, to permit","l":"позволить"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"money"}]}]}